{
  "name": "Posta webhook to AI comment auto-reply",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI comment auto-reply (LinkedIn + TikTok)\n\nWhen a post publishes, wait for the first comments to land, then draft brand-voice replies with an LLM. Ships **review-first**: replies only auto-post when `AUTO_REPLY=true` — otherwise they go to Slack for a human.\n\n> Scope: Posta's comments inbox is **LinkedIn and TikTok**. Most schedulers have no comments-reply API at all — this is Posta-only.\n\n### Setup\n\n- [ ] Point a Posta **outbound webhook** (`post.published`) at the `Posta webhook` node URL\n- [ ] `POSTA_WEBHOOK_SECRET` in n8n env (webhook signing secret)\n- [ ] Header Auth creds: `Posta API` (`Authorization: Bearer posta_…`), `OpenAI API`\n- [ ] `AUTO_REPLY` env: leave unset/`false` for the first week (review in Slack), set `true` once you trust it\n- [ ] `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL` in n8n env\n\nSignature: `HMAC-SHA256(secret, \"{X-Posta-Timestamp}.{rawBody}\")` → `X-Posta-Signature` (verified constant-time).",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 480
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1240,
        -160
      ],
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-9000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "posta-comment-reply",
        "options": {
          "rawBody": true
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -700,
        160
      ],
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-9000-000000000002",
      "name": "Posta webhook",
      "webhookId": "posta-comment-reply"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Verify Posta's HMAC over `{timestamp}.{rawBody}` (constant-time); emit payload.\nconst crypto = require('crypto');\nconst item = $input.first();\nconst headers = item.json.headers || {};\nconst sig = headers['x-posta-signature'];\nconst ts = headers['x-posta-timestamp'];\nif (!sig || !ts) throw new Error('Missing X-Posta-Signature / X-Posta-Timestamp');\nconst raw = item.binary && item.binary.data\n  ? Buffer.from(item.binary.data, 'base64').toString('utf8')\n  : JSON.stringify(item.json.body);\nconst secret = $env.POSTA_WEBHOOK_SECRET;\nif (!secret) throw new Error('Set POSTA_WEBHOOK_SECRET in n8n env');\nconst expected = crypto.createHmac('sha256', secret).update(`${ts}.${raw}`).digest('hex');\nconst a = Buffer.from(sig); const b = Buffer.from(expected);\nif (a.length !== b.length || !crypto.timingSafeEqual(a, b)) throw new Error('Bad signature');\nreturn [{ json: JSON.parse(raw) }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -460,
        160
      ],
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-9000-000000000003",
      "name": "Verify signature"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 30,
        "unit": "minutes"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -220,
        160
      ],
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-9000-000000000004",
      "name": "Wait 30 min for comments",
      "webhookId": "posta-comment-reply-wait"
    },
